{"server":"tw","storyId":"story_scave_set_1_story_1","groupId":"story_scave_set_1","stageId":null,"title":"硬幣的意志","storyCode":null,"avgTag":"幕間","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/obt/memory/story_scave_1_1.txt","sourceHash":"1c40a44c8064fec06f72dc1dea55df6dd00f85261be4c0310f9e4073d0136c4f","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"受羅德島雇用後不久，清道夫在一次任務中意外遇見了當年暗算自己的仇人。","blocks":[{"type":"narration","text":"末药"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"砸碎我家窗戶的人，就是這個女孩嗎？\n嗯，入室行竊的話，根據族群的規矩，確實應該被沒收所有東西，扔到荒地上去......\n不過她只是從儲藏室拿走了一塊乾乳酪而已呀。嘿，你叫什麼名字？\n哈莫琳......這樣吧，哈莫琳，我用扔硬幣來決定你的命運吧。\n如果是數字的這一面朝上，你就要被趕走；如果是頭像這一面朝上，我就放過你。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cherunder_2"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......報告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這是......第七天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"今天早上又有死者被處理掉了......建築內部的環境源石顆粒密度應該很高，感染者狀況惡化很迅速。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最近二十四小時內，依然沒有看到工廠員工在高牆未遮擋的區域活動，更沒有人從大門離開工廠。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走到稍微更靠近工廠的地方，通訊信號就會受到強烈干擾。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工廠外圍是高壓電網，控制室的位置暫時無法確認。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"高牆附近守衛的換班時間和巡邏規律已經摸清楚了。內部警備情況還沒辦法知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我倒是想快點把手頭的事情做完，你同意的話，我可以採取最暴力的手段。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哼，羅德島有自己的做事風格，我明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另一個方案？每天凌晨三點，工廠的廢料運輸載具會進入地下層，排汙管道會暫停使用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"戴上防毒面具的話，從那裡走沒問題。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"反正，我只負責癱瘓這裡的安保系統，後續的接應和引導不歸我做，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我知道。必要的時候，可以做得不那麼清白乾淨。你們叫我來處理這件事，就是為了這個吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彙報完畢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這家叫羅德島的雇主，竟然真的想救感染者......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"聽到載具出入口開啟的噪音了......該出發了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_20_G08"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"工廠守衛","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"呃——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你先昏一會兒吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的安保系統看起來簡直像監獄的一樣複雜......算了，本來也是差不多的地方。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要在驚動其他人之前找到控制室——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"再往前走就要觸發自動報警了——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"——啊？怎麼是你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......圖利奧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"“清道夫”，呵，竟然還活著......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"你怎麼會出現在這裡？小老鼠，既然你拿著武器，你是從哪條下水道爬進來的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"——等等，先把刀放下，我們好好說話。不然，我要拉響警報了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡的系統是連接到警察局的，任何警報都會被視作感染者失控的信號。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你也是這裡的警備人員？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"是，但是相信我，清道夫......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，相信你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"我們現在的目標應該是一致的。我看到你把那個守衛放倒了，你在找出去的路，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"我也想逃出去，不然我剛剛不會拉你一把。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"唉，真的，這幾年我已經洗心革面啦。你看，我現在也是感染者了，我也經歷了很多慘事，我......理解你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"既然你都鑽進這家工廠了，應該也知道這裡的情況了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我是所謂的警備人員，但被關在這裡的所有人，境遇都沒什麼差別。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你明明在監管他們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"你知道這家工廠是用很多好聽的說辭把感染者騙來的......我也不想這樣，但要活命就不得不做一些沒那麼體面的事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別指望我會同情你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，還有最重要的......我對這裡的安保系統很熟悉。沒有我幫忙，你逃不過那些監控。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"有兩處監控中心在同時監管整個工廠的狀況。通過切斷總閘的方式來中斷監控是行不通的，工廠會迅速切換到應急電源。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"你必須找一個同伴，當然，我也必須有人幫忙。所以無論你有多不信任我，至少我們現在最好的做法就是暫時合作。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我沒說我要逃出去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你防備著我，但是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——我要讓這裡的安保系統完全癱瘓。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我接的委託就是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有雇傭兵會直截了當把委託任務告訴別人？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別廢話。我想快點把工作做完，告訴我監控中心的位置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"......好吧，這算是達成合作了吧？你是這個意思吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你的打算，清道夫。我不會直接告訴你所有路線的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"我們走這邊，靠著牆根走。我已經確認過監控死角了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工廠負責人在這裡嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"不在，當然不在，這都已經凌晨三點多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"他只是偶爾出現。一個健康的人是不會想在源石顆粒密度這麼高的環境中生活的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這裡都是感染者？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"是。對你來說沒什麼區別吧？你都已經感染了，再接觸幾個也無所謂。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"你的同夥呢？應該做好防護準備了吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"他們想要什麼？工廠裡沒什麼值錢的東西，這裡的源石製品精度也不高。我真想不通你們為什麼要來這種地方偷東西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"......什麼都不回答啊。以前跟你談生意的時候，你可沒這麼難溝通。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"雖說你要是還和以前一樣的話，大概也沒法在雇傭兵這行活下來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別問多餘的事情，也別廢話。我可沒那麼想跟你這種東西當同夥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"......嘁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"但現在我們不得不當同夥了。從這裡我們要分頭往兩邊走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"穿過工作室，那邊就是監控中心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就十分鐘後各自動手，之後我會去找你。會合之後我們再去總控室處理整個安保系統。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你最好是真的洗心革面了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"其實那枚硬幣落下來的時候，我是知道哪一面會朝上的。\n來，把手伸出來，我教你，像這樣——\n沒事的，哈莫琳，你雖然感染了，但也不用離我那麼遠的。\n是啊，以後就更遠了......明天早上你就要從這裡離開了吧？\n抱歉......這件事，我也沒辦法左右。\n我們都知道你是為了族群的生存資源而感染的，可是族群卻不肯留下你......是啊，只是為了生存下去就不得不冒險，一直都是這樣。\n作為留念，收下這枚銀幣吧。\n無論在哪裡，無論發生什麼......我希望你能活下去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_prison_commandroom"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"基地台信號遮罩儀已經關閉了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"接下來，高壓電網......斷電。電動大門......開啟。拉下總閘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"呼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"完成了？——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖......！我就知道！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這傢伙！又想暗算我？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這對你有什麼好處？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，總得試一下吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你覺得你能得手嗎？我總不至於被你這種小人欺騙第二次！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"不然我該做什麼？就這麼等著你把我殺掉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"現在你我都不需要同伴了，工廠的大門敞開，誰都可以輕鬆逃走。比起當被害者，我當然選擇先下手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒說我要殺你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"你當然不會說。但你怎麼可能放過我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"我現在也是感染者了，我知道你當初有多走投無路了......也知道你該有多恨我了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊，能讓我記住臉的委託人可不多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖，札拉克竟然能有這麼大力氣......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我說過，你不可能得手的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別動，不然這把刀就砍下去了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"嘖......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你該搞清楚了，現在殺不殺你全由我自己的心情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"你......這該死的礦石病黏上了我，讓我變得虛弱，你怎麼還安然無恙？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"你是怎麼做到的......你完全變了一個人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，你當然會希望我還是剛開始做雇傭兵時的樣子，單純，好騙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幹了件沒人願意做的髒活，卻沒有從委託人那裡拿到任何報酬。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"因為礦石病發作而痛到失去意識，在陰溝裡醒來，發現自己僅有的家當也被順手拿走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"那時我以為你活不久了，所以我想物盡其用......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呵，物盡其用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"在刀尖上過日子的人，不都是默認要這麼互相利用的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"而且我又能做什麼？等著一個感染者死掉並且在我面前造成擴散感染？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"誰能想到你活下來了，而且一直活到今天？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是啊，可能因為有人希望我活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我醒來的時候，縫在衣服裡的那枚銀幣還在，所以我決定活下去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"你這隻老鼠的生命力可真頑強。一枚銀幣能換到什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不用它換什麼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"那你是怎麼......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就像你被騙到這座工廠來，以為這裡會給感染者提供相對穩定的生活，結果面對的卻是惡劣的生存環境和非人的待遇。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我經歷的也無非就是這些，可能更差一點。但生活就是這樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"你那是什麼口氣......說得就好像我跟你是一樣的東西......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大家都是一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"......哈，我懂了，你看到我現在的樣子，是不是很想嘲笑我？是不是有一種報復的快感？難怪你沒那麼生氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嘁......想得可真多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，就是你讓我落到今天這個境地的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"就是因為找上了你這個感染者雇傭兵，沒過多久我也跟著出現了礦石病的症狀。我從一開始就該遠離感染者！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你這傢伙最好搞清楚，平時接觸到感染者可不會讓你得礦石病。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"你覺得我會相信這種話？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我沒什麼興趣糾正你的想法，只不過這是我現在雇主的看法，我得替他們這麼說。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......哦，難怪你害怕我復仇，卻還是要讓我當你的“同夥”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你想讓我幫你逃出去，然後處理掉我，完成你想像中的“復仇”。你所謂的“物盡其用”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"哈，難道你不是這麼想的嗎？你一路上配合我，不也是等著現在下手？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"到這時候還廢話什麼，還要我教你這地方是怎麼處理死掉的感染者的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，我跟你合作，只是為了快點完成我的委託任務。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我能忍受惡劣的工作環境，這也包括能忍受惡劣的同夥。我可不會像你一樣想東想西的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再說，這次我的任務是協助救出感染者，而你也是感染者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"救出感染者？開什麼玩笑......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，問問雇主吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......報告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工廠安保系統已經癱瘓，但負責人不在園區內。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我不關心你們要怎麼把那些感染者救出去，或者要把他們帶去哪裡。我只想確認，我的任務算不算完成。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"工廠的守衛也是感染者，這種人你們也要救嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......所以，我可以用自己的手段處理這方面的麻煩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明白。我會儘快撤離到指定地點。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"彙報完畢。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼......看來他們真的打算說到做到。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放在以前，我可不信會有什麼可靠的委託人，更不會相信有把感染者當一回事的傢伙......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就像她的願望不可能實現一樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——不過，你也聽到了，他們給了我一點自由。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圖利奧","speakerId":"avg_npc_194","isRemote":false,"text":"......還真是除了雇主的要求什麼都不想啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......既然你覺得我什麼都不想，那我用扔硬幣來決定你的命運吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"清道夫","speakerId":"avg_149_scave_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果是數字的這一面朝上，我就把你這垃圾清理掉；如果是頭像這一面朝上，我就放你走，讓你像其他感染者一樣，重新開始生活。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"清道夫摸出了那枚小小的銀幣，拋向空中。\n曾經許多次，她在孤獨無助的時候，閉上眼睛將一切寄託於擲硬幣的結果。\n“也許有一天，你不用為活著本身拼盡全力的時候，你就會去想自己要往哪裡走吧。”\n她不知道像她這樣的人會不會有那一天。\n但這一次，她知道硬幣的答案。"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
